@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title ContextFilter — Application flow

actor User
component UI
component "Application Use Cases" as UC
component "Context / Projection Services" as CTX
component "FilterEvaluator" as FE
component "Action Calculators" as AC
component "Application Ports" as Ports
component Domain
component Revit
component Infrastructure

User --> UI
UI --> UC
UC --> Domain
UC --> CTX
CTX --> Ports : collect / index / values
CTX --> Domain : snapshots / context models
UC --> FE
FE --> Domain : FilterDefinition / FilterResult
UC --> AC
AC --> Domain : action intent
UC --> Ports
Ports --> Revit
Ports --> Infrastructure

note right of FE
Evaluation strategy is execution policy,
not filter semantics.
end note

note bottom of Ports
Ports define required capabilities.
Adapters own implementation details.
end note
@enduml